==Strategy==
A simple stage, use the [[:Category:Normal Cats|Normal Cats]] to easily beat it. [[Cow Cat (Normal Cat)|Giraffe Cat]] or any [[:Category:Critical Hit Cats|Critical Hit Cats]] can easily deal with the [[Metal Hippoe]]s that appear throughout the stage.

